\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40750000000000003,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":97126,\"title\":\"The Galloped Era\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lohAHsgy0BRHoOqyOdDIV4yadvH.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40731707317073174,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":96997,\"title\":\"Yanxi Palace: Princess Adventures\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2XsXarTzSuPFOMD4J4036IS02u6.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40731707317073174,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Newlyweds Sridevi and Yash marry in India, but are forced to spend four years apart when he moves to Australia for a medical traineeship. Finally reunited in Australia, they try to come to terms with all that's happened in the intervening years.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cLvfzyYLwsP31qmhoPKNInIERXi.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Yash and Sridevi meet, fall in love and get married. But the couple are forced to live apart when Yash discovers he must leave India for his medical traineeship in Australia.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nn9Rex7xznH94MBpcHOkZw1MDl5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"As Yash leaves for his medical traineeship in Australia, Sridevi stays back in India with his family, putting the hopes for her future on hold. Four years later, she arrives in Australia.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fbqMQB9Fvcm7CrnZDLP7TJ5m3jl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Yash takes Sridevi on a surprise trip to a waterhole in the Australian wilderness. It is romantic and passionate, but when Sridevi expresses her desire to start a family, Yash responds negatively.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fGDNJ72El5217P3CMLsgCtmjCJO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"With a new resolution to tell no more lies, Sridevi thinks it is time to reveal her own secret, which risks destroying their already strained relationship.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5ig2kXb9oYsAHi9DdYy0s7kl4pp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Yash throws himself into work and study; Sridevi finds happiness in a new job and her friendship with Gabs.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8otjqkqTvmuIqtHrGQavkyTkNZF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"Sridevi and Yash finally find joy in their unexpected pregnancy, but just as they move closer to their dream life, their joy starts slipping through their fingers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ee28JvStEkiTubm1i6X8SEVOo6l.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"With his exam looming, Yash is laser-focused but barely coping; when Yash doesn't return home after his exam, Sridevi is forced to ask Jamal for help.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3mw2dkbrD656BPHIifpKawnbfU9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"Back in India for Yash's sister's wedding, Sridevi and Yash are forced to confront the truth about what they each want in life.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f5VP9m7B715KrGGpPhhiKFVSukz.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-02\",\"runtime\":29}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2024-10-02\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}